       "explicacion": "«sein + zu + Infinitiv» expresses formal obligation in normative texts.",
       "correcta": true
      },
      {
       "texto": "To a stative passive in the past: «Die Richtlinien waren bereits beachtet worden».",
       "lengua": "alumno",
       "explicacion": "It doesn't express a past fact, but a current requirement.",
       "correcta": false
